{"created":"2019-11-20T11:07:46.255777","createdBy":101,"modified":"2026-09-03T12:17:21.780258","modifiedBy":10,"key":2036,"type":"taxonomic","origin":"external","attempt":168,"imported":"2026-09-03T12:17:25.783296","lastImportAttempt":"2026-09-03T12:17:25.793961","lastImportState":"finished","gbifKey":"c696e5ee-9088-4d11-bdae-ab88daffab78","gbifPublisherKey":"1249271c-25ff-45c2-adb3-264dd38798b5","size":33722,"doi":"10.48580/d4g8","versionDoi":"10.48580/d4g8.v168","title":"IOC World Bird List","alias":"IOC","description":"The IOC World Bird List is a free, openly available resource maintained by the International\nOrnithological Committee (IOC). It represents the most current, comprehensive listing of all\nextant bird species of the world, compiled with the aim of promoting the stability of scientific\nand English names of birds worldwide. The list provides scientific names, English names,\nauthorities, and geographic ranges for all species, as well as subspecies for each species.\n\nIt is widely used as a standard reference for bird taxonomy by ornithologists, birders,\nconservation organisations, and government agencies around the world. The IOC list is updated\ntwice annually, incorporating new species discoveries, taxonomic revisions based on recent\nphylogenetic work, and changes in nomenclature.\n\nThe multilingual edition additionally provides vernacular names in more than 40 languages.","issued":"2026-08-30","version":"15.2","contact":{"url":"https://www.worldbirdnames.org/","name":"International Ornithological Committee (IOC)","organisation":"International Ornithological Committee (IOC)"},"editor":[{"given":"Frank","family":"Gill","name":"Gill F."},{"given":"David","family":"Donsker","name":"Donsker D."},{"given":"Pamela","family":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen P."}],"contributor":[{"given":"Per","family":"Alström","note":"advisor","name":"Alström P."},{"given":"Bruce","family":"Beehler","note":"advisor","name":"Beehler B."},{"given":"Michael","family":"Blair","note":"advisor","name":"Blair M."},{"given":"Rauri","family":"Bowie","note":"advisor","name":"Bowie R."},{"given":"Sally","family":"Conyne","note":"advisor; compiling Ranges","name":"Conyne S."},{"given":"Jon","family":"Fjeldså","note":"advisor","name":"Fjeldså J."},{"given":"Phil","family":"Gregory","note":"advisor","name":"Gregory P."},{"given":"Leo","family":"Joseph","note":"advisor","name":"Joseph L."},{"given":"Peter","family":"Kovalik","note":"advisor; spreadsheet magic","name":"Kovalik P."},{"given":"Adolfo","family":"Navarro-Siguenza","note":"advisor","name":"Navarro-Siguenza A."},{"given":"David T","family":"Parkin","note":"advisor","name":"Parkin D. T"},{"given":"Alan","family":"Peterson","note":"advisor","name":"Peterson A."},{"given":"J","family":"Praveen","note":"advisor","name":"Praveen J"},{"given":"Doug","family":"Pratt","note":"advisor","name":"Pratt D."},{"given":"Thane","family":"Pratt","note":"advisor","name":"Pratt T."},{"given":"Nigel","family":"Redman","note":"advisor","name":"Redman N."},{"given":"Frank","family":"Rheindt","note":"advisor","name":"Rheindt F."},{"given":"Robert","family":"Ridgely","note":"advisor","name":"Ridgely R."},{"given":"Peter","family":"Ryan","note":"advisor","name":"Ryan P."},{"given":"George","family":"Sangster","note":"advisor","name":"Sangster G."},{"given":"Richard","family":"Schodde","note":"advisor","name":"Schodde R."},{"given":"Christophe","family":"Streissel","note":"advisor","name":"Streissel C."},{"given":"Larry","family":"Master","note":"photos","name":"Master L."},{"given":"Colin","family":"Campbell","note":"photos","name":"Campbell C."},{"given":"Geoff","family":"Jones","note":"photos","name":"Jones G."},{"given":"Eric","family":"Swanzey","note":"website expertise","name":"Swanzey E."}],"geographicScope":"global","taxonomicScope":"Aves","confidence":5,"completeness":100,"license":"cc by","url":"https://www.worldbirdnames.org/new/ioc-lists/master-list-2/","logo":"https://www.worldbirdnames.org/img/hd